00:04:15.004 --> 00:04:17.966
E-mail simmsandlefkoe@gmail.com

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:21.386
if you'd like to be
there Thursday at 6:00.

00:04:21.386 --> 00:04:23.596
- Saints fans are welcome!
- That's what I'm worried about.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:24.889
- Yeah!
- I need the real

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:27.100
"Simms &amp; Lefkoe"
fans to get in there

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.394
because I'm just worried it's
gonna be a bunch of Mr. Beans

00:04:29.394 --> 00:04:31.521
that are Saints fans
for the entire show.

00:04:31.521 --> 00:04:33.064
- Yeah, you might have that.
Sorry.

00:04:33.064 --> 00:04:34.816
- I'm really nervous.
- Yeah, that's all right.

00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:36.526
Hey, it was a good season,
though. No joke.

00:04:36.526 --> 00:04:37.694
Philly—
- For the Eagles.

00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:39.279
- Yeah, for what they did.
- No joke?

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:40.655
- No joke.
I'm not even messing around.

00:04:40.655 --> 00:04:42.365
A Super Bowl team

00:04:42.365 --> 00:04:44.951
to basically fall off the earth
midway through the year.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.619
- Yes.
- And usually when

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:48.079
